<item><title>Renamo presses parliament over water pollution inquiry in Moma and Larde</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/renamo-presses-parliament-over-water-pollution-inquiry-in-8b85c9/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/renamo-presses-parliament-over-water-pollution-inquiry-in-8b85c9/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>The opposition movement renewed its call for a parliamentary commission after a request filed about 14 days ago received no response.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 08:12:19 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" length="36290" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mozambique&apos;s Supreme Court questions Mondlane over 2024 unrest</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-s-supreme-court-questions-mondlane-over-2024-6a2ad3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-s-supreme-court-questions-mondlane-over-2024-6a2ad3/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>The former presidential candidate said his broadcasts sought support for electoral truth and justice, not destructive acts attributed to them.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:42:16 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" length="36290" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mz.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
