<item><title>Mozambique approves plan change for ExxonMobil&apos;s Rovuma LNG project</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-approves-plan-change-for-exxonmobil-s-rovuma-lng-662e26/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-approves-plan-change-for-exxonmobil-s-rovuma-lng-662e26/</guid><category>Mozambique</category><description>The revised plan allows new technical choices, including electric gas-processing equipment, after deals on gas sales, domestic supply and state participation were settled.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:12:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-approves-plan-change-for-exxonmobil-s-rovuma-lng-662e26/share.jpg" length="40563" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mz/mozambique-approves-plan-change-for-exxonmobil-s-rovuma-lng-662e26/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
